NOTE: The apple-touch-icon.png should be a 180x180px PNG version of the favicon design.

To create this file:
1. Export the favicon.svg design as a PNG at 180x180px resolution
2. Ensure the background is solid (#0a0a0a - obsidian)
3. The wolf design should be centered and clearly visible at small sizes

This file is used when users save the HAVEN website to their iOS home screen.

Recommended export settings:
- Size: 180x180px
- Format: PNG
- Background: Solid #0a0a0a
- Quality: High (no compression artifacts)

Tools you can use:
- Figma: Export as PNG at 180x180
- Inkscape: Export PNG with custom dimensions
- Adobe Illustrator: Export for Screens
- Online SVG to PNG converters

The favicon.svg design has been created to work well at this size.
